
### Create a recipe
POST http://localhost:8080/api/recipes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Vegetable Sandwich",
  "description": "A quick and healthy vegetable sandwich.",
  "ingredients": "4 bread slices, 1 tomato, 1 cucumber, 2 tablespoons butter, salt to taste",
  "instructions": "1. Slice the vegetables. 2. Spread butter on the bread. 3. Add vegetables and salt. 4. Close the sandwich and serve.",
  "prepTimeMinutes": 15,
  "servings": 2
}
